{"task_id": "Mbpp/61", "solution": "def count_Substrings(s: str) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Count substrings where sum of digits equals substring length.\n    \n    Iterates through all possible substrings, calculates their digit sum, and checks the condition.\n    \"\"\"\n    count = 0\n    n = len(s)\n\n    # Iterate through all possible starting positions\n    for i in range(n):\n        current_sum = 0\n        # Iterate through all possible ending positions for the current start\n        for j in range(i, n):\n            current_sum += int(s[j])\n            substring_length = (j - i) + 1\n            if current_sum == substring_length:\n                count += 1\n    return count"}
