{"task_id": "Mbpp/68", "solution": "def is_Monotonic(array):\n    \"\"\"\n    Checks if the given array is monotonic (non-decreasing or non-increasing).\n    Handles empty arrays and single-element arrays as monotonic.\n    \"\"\"\n    if len(array) <= 1:\n        return True\n\n    def _is_non_decreasing(arr):\n        \"\"\"Checks if the array is non-decreasing.\"\"\"\n        for i in range(len(arr) - 1):\n            if arr[i] > arr[i+1]:\n                return False\n        return True\n\n    def _is_non_increasing(arr):\n        \"\"\"Checks if the array is non-increasing.\"\"\"\n        for i in range(len(arr) - 1):\n            if arr[i] < arr[i+1]:\n                return False\n        return True\n\n    return _is_non_decreasing(array) or _is_non_increasing(array)"}
