{"task_id": "Mbpp/290", "solution": "from typing import List, Tuple\n\ndef max_length(list_of_lists: List[List[int]]) -> Tuple[int, List[int]]:\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds the list of maximum length in a list of lists.\n    Returns a tuple containing the maximum length and the first encountered longest list.\n    \"\"\"\n    max_len = 0\n    longest_list = []\n\n    for sublist in list_of_lists:\n        current_length = len(sublist)\n        if current_length > max_len:\n            max_len = current_length\n            longest_list = sublist\n            \n    return (max_len, longest_list)"}
