{"task_id": "Mbpp/286", "solution": "import math\n\ndef max_sub_array_sum_repeated(arr, k, n):\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds the largest sum of a contiguous subarray in a modified array which is\n    formed by repeating the given array k times.\n    \"\"\"\n\n    if not arr or k == 0:\n        return 0\n\n    # Helper function for Kadane's algorithm (standard version, returns max single element if all negative)\n    def _kadane_strict(arr_input):\n        if not arr_input:\n            return 0  # Should not be reached if outer function handles empty arr and k=0\n\n        max_so_far = arr_input[0]\n        current_max = arr_input[0]\n\n        for i in range(1, len(arr_input)):\n            current_max = max(arr_input[i], current_max + arr_input[i])\n            max_so_far = max(max_so_far, current_max)\n        \n        return max_so_far\n\n    max_kadane_one_arr = _kadane_strict(arr)\n    total_sum_arr = sum(arr)\n\n    if k == 1:\n        return max_kadane_one_arr\n    \n    # Calculate max prefix sum and max suffix sum of the original array 'arr'\n    # These sums can be negative.\n    max_prefix_sum_arr = -math.inf\n    current_prefix_sum = 0\n    for x in arr:\n        current_prefix_sum += x\n        max_prefix_sum_arr = max(max_prefix_sum_arr, current_prefix_sum)\n    \n    max_suffix_sum_arr = -math.inf\n    current_suffix_sum = 0\n    for x in reversed(arr):\n        current_suffix_sum += x\n        max_suffix_sum_arr = max(max_suffix_sum_arr, current_suffix_sum)\n\n    # Initialize answer with the maximum sum found within a single block\n    ans = max_kadane_one_arr\n\n    # Case 1: Subarray spans exactly one boundary (suffix of first block + prefix of second block)\n    ans = max(ans, max_prefix_sum_arr + max_suffix_sum_arr)\n\n    # Case 2: Subarray spans multiple blocks (suffix of first + (k-2)*total_sum + prefix of last)\n    # This is only beneficial if the total sum of the array is positive.\n    if total_sum_arr > 0:\n        ans = max(ans, max_prefix_sum_arr + (total_sum_arr * (k - 2)) + max_suffix_sum_arr)\n    \n    return ans"}
