{"task_id": "Mbpp/392", "solution": "memo = {}\n\ndef get_max_sum(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculate maximum sum using f(n) = max((f(n/2) + f(n/3) + f(n/4) + f(n/5)), n).\n    This function uses memoization to store previously computed results.\n    \"\"\"\n    if n <= 0:\n        return 0\n\n    if n in memo:\n        return memo[n]\n\n    sum_of_parts = (get_max_sum(n // 2) +\n                    get_max_sum(n // 3) +\n                    get_max_sum(n // 4) +\n                    get_max_sum(n // 5))\n\n    result = max(sum_of_parts, n)\n    memo[n] = result\n    return result"}
