{"task_id": "Mbpp/398", "solution": "def sum_of_digits(numbers):\n    \"\"\"\n    Computes the sum of all individual digits from numbers in a given list.\n    Handles negative numbers by considering their absolute values.\n    \"\"\"\n    \n    def _extract_digits(number):\n        \"\"\"\n        Extracts individual digits from a single number, handling its absolute value.\n        \"\"\"\n        s = str(abs(number))\n        return [int(digit) for digit in s]\n\n    def _calculate_sum(digits):\n        \"\"\"\n        Calculates the sum of a list of digit values.\n        \"\"\"\n        return sum(digits)\n\n    all_digits = []\n    for number in numbers:\n        extracted = _extract_digits(number)\n        all_digits.extend(extracted)\n    \n    return _calculate_sum(all_digits)"}
