{"task_id": "Mbpp/462", "solution": "def combinations_list(input_list):\n    \"\"\"\n    Generate all possible combinations of input list elements.\n\n    Args:\n        input_list (List): Input list of elements\n\n    Returns:\n        List[List]: List of all combinations in binary pattern order\n    \"\"\"\n    n = len(input_list)\n    result = []\n    # Iterate from 0 to 2^n - 1 to generate all binary patterns\n    for i in range(1 << n):\n        current_combination = []\n        # For each bit in the binary pattern, include the corresponding element\n        for j in range(n):\n            if (i >> j) & 1:\n                current_combination.append(input_list[j])\n        result.append(current_combination)\n    return result"}
