{"task_id": "Mbpp/473", "solution": "def normalize_tuple(tup):\n    \"\"\"Converts a tuple to a frozenset for order-independent comparison.\"\"\"\n    return frozenset(tup)\n\ndef find_matches(list1, list2):\n    \"\"\"Identifies matching tuples between two lists based on normalized forms.\"\"\"\n    normalized_list2_elements = {normalize_tuple(t) for t in list2}\n    result = set()\n    for t1 in list1:\n        if normalize_tuple(t1) in normalized_list2_elements:\n            result.add(t1)\n    return result\n\ndef tuple_intersection(list1: list, list2: list) -> set:\n    \"\"\"\n    Find intersection of tuples between two lists with order-independent comparison.\n\n    Args:\n        list1: First list of tuples\n        list2: Second list of tuples\n\n    Returns:\n        Set of tuples that exist in both lists (in original form from list1)\n    \"\"\"\n    return find_matches(list1, list2)"}
