{"task_id": "Mbpp/583", "solution": "def factorial(k):\n    \"\"\"Calculates the factorial of a non-negative integer k.\"\"\"\n    if k == 0:\n        return 1\n    res = 1\n    for i in range(1, k + 1):\n        res *= i\n    return res\n\ndef catalan_number(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the nth Catalan number using the formula C(n) = (2n)! / ((n+1)! * n!).\n    This function relies on the auxiliary factorial function.\n    \"\"\"\n    numerator = factorial(2 * n)\n    denominator = factorial(n + 1) * factorial(n)\n    return numerator // denominator"}
