{"task_id": "Mbpp/630", "solution": "def get_coordinates(coord_tuple: tuple) -> list[list[int]]:\n    \"\"\"\n    Extract all adjacent coordinates in a 3x3 grid pattern, including the input coordinate.\n    Coordinates are returned as a list of lists in row-major order.\n    \"\"\"\n    x_base, y_base = coord_tuple\n    adjacent_coordinates = []\n\n    # Iterate through offsets for x-coordinate (-1, 0, 1)\n    for dx in range(-1, 2):\n        # Iterate through offsets for y-coordinate (-1, 0, 1)\n        for dy in range(-1, 2):\n            new_x = x_base + dx\n            new_y = y_base + dy\n            adjacent_coordinates.append([new_x, new_y])\n\n    return adjacent_coordinates"}
