{"task_id": "Mbpp/793", "solution": "def last(array, target):\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds the last position (index) of an element in a sorted array.\n    Uses an iterative binary search variant to find the rightmost occurrence.\n    \"\"\"\n    left = 0\n    right = len(array) - 1\n    result = -1\n\n    while left <= right:\n        mid = left + (right - left) // 2\n        if array[mid] == target:\n            result = mid\n            left = mid + 1  # Try to find a further occurrence in the right half\n        elif array[mid] < target:\n            left = mid + 1\n        else:  # array[mid] > target\n            right = mid - 1\n            \n    return result"}
